$ This file deliberately contains common input mistakes.
$ Open the Problems panel (Ctrl+Shift+M) to see what the extension reports,
$ and use the light bulb (Ctrl+.) on the first GRID for a quick fix.
BEGIN BULK
$ integer in a real field (X1, X2, X3 need a decimal point)
GRID    1               0       0       0
$ two values typed into one 8-character field
GRID    2               1. 2.   0.
$ exponent without decimal point
MAT1    1       2E11            .3
$ text beyond column 80 is ignored by Nastran
CROD    1       1       1       2                                                       99
$ duplicate element ID
CROD    1       1       2       3
$ missing include file
INCLUDE 'does/not/exist.bdf'
$ continuation without a parent card (INCLUDE ended the previous card)
+       1.      2.
ENDDATA
